Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,That’s me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.62,0:01:10.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.91,0:01:13.42,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.54,0:01:18.02,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.14,0:01:20.74,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k52}Ri{\k44}bon {\k38}no {\k35}ki{\k59}shi {\k115}wa{\k17}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The Princess Knight,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k6}{\k50}Hon{\k43}to {\k33}wa {\k92}hon{\k43}tto {\k49}wa{\k24}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Truly, truly,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k18}{\k23}A{\k23}ta{\k27}shi {\k35}na{\k35}no {\k159}sa{\k0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,It’s really me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.10,0:01:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Twenty-Fourth Episode\NThe Assassins
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.78,0:01:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Before we get to\Ntoday's story,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.26,0:01:58.09,Default,,0,0,0,,let's briefly recall\Nthe previous episodes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.14,0:02:01.21,Default,,0,0,0,,The King disappeared\Nand it was decided that Sapphire
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.26,0:02:03.49,Default,,0,0,0,,...would become the new King.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.66,0:02:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,But on the day of the coronation\Nceremony,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.46,0:02:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,the Queen was deceived\Nby the evil Duralumin and Nylon..
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.74,0:02:13.73,Default,,0,0,0,,...and she revealed that Sapphire\Nwas a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.54,0:02:19.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Therefore, Sapphire and the Queen were\Nlocked in the coffin tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.42,0:02:26.73,Default,,0,0,0,,As a result, Duralumin felt\Nfree to tyrannize the people.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.54,0:02:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Hearing of this,\NSapphire escaped...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.26,0:02:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,...through the hole\Nthat a little mouse showed her
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.98,0:02:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,And in the guise\Nof the phantom knight,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.14,0:02:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,she defeated Duralumin's retinue\Nand saved the suffering prisoners.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.02,0:02:43.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, Duralumin was preparing\Na cruel plan:
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.06,0:02:46.61,Default,,0,0,0,,suspecting that the phantom\Nknight could be Sapphire,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.66,0:02:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,he sent skilled assassins\Nto the tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.46,0:02:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, the life of Sapphire\Nand the Queen is in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.34,0:02:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us now proceed to narrate\Ntoday's episode.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.14,0:03:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,This damn mouse!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.02,0:03:41.33,Default,,0,0,0,,So, tell me: what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.02,0:03:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, cute little mouse,\Nbut I really don't understand you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.02,0:04:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,But what is it you want to tell me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.26,0:04:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Assassins?! Surely they\Nhave come here to kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.02,0:04:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Little mouse,\Nthank you for warning me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.34,0:04:29.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- Mother, assassins are coming!\N- What? Assassins?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.38,0:04:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Absolutely do not open the door!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.02,0:04:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.90,0:04:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to get rid of the assassins!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.50,0:05:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Gama, show us where the\Nroom is of Sapphire and the Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.14,0:05:08.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Come!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.86,0:05:15.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire...!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.78,0:05:24.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- They are in this room.\N- Are you really sure they are here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.30,0:05:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I locked them securely inside and\Nle ho mai lasciate uscire da qui,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.78,0:05:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,except to make them work.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.26,0:05:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.18,0:05:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't like it very much.\NThey are just a girl and a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.82,0:05:40.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up and listen! After I have\Nmade a hole in this door,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.94,0:05:44.46,Default,,0,0,0,,all you have to do is\Nthrow the rocket bomb inside
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.30,0:05:48.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- Okay!\N- If the other three show up
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.78,0:05:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,kill them!\NDo you understand? Now light it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.66,0:06:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- Don't you think that's a bit much?\N- Will you cut it out?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.10,0:06:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.46,0:06:22.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- The Phantom Knight!\N- Hey, assassins!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.90,0:06:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What?! But how did you get in?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.42,0:06:27.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I can enter\Nfrom anywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.54,0:06:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I will kill anyone who harms\Nthe Queen and Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.22,0:07:12.21,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't you dare ever again\Nget close to...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.26,0:07:14.49,Default,,0,0,0,,...the Queen\Nand Princess Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.94,0:07:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It's strange...\NThat voice and that appearance.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.74,0:07:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's as if I have\Nalready known him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.42,0:07:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.50,0:07:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It's impossible..!\NHe looks a lot like her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.90,0:07:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I've got it! It's almost impossible,\Nbut he looks a lot like her!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.58,0:07:54.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I must make sure of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.38,0:08:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I got scared! It's you, Gama!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.38,0:08:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Gama, it was terrible!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.30,0:08:30.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Many horrible men\Ntried to kill us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.18,0:08:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,But a man called\N"phantom knight"...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.58,0:08:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,..appeared and helped us
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.50,0:08:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, Gama, but who the hell is\Nthe phantom knight?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.34,0:08:41.81,Default,,0,0,0,,So it's not her!\NBut she looks so much like her!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.02,0:08:45.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't waste time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.06,0:08:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It must have been Duralumin\Nwho sent those assassins.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.62,0:08:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I think he deserves a good lesson\Nand I'll make sure to give it to him!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.46,0:09:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The ghost knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.94,0:09:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Open the gate! I have something\Nto settle with Duralumin!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.90,0:09:15.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Open the gate!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.86,0:09:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I never! Well, I never! Well, I\Nnever! Well, I never! Well, I never!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.10,0:09:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I never!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.42,0:09:29.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It happened that... It happened...\NYou see, it happened that...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.38,0:09:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,But what the hell happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.30,0:09:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The ghost knight wants to\Nforce his way into the castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.54,0:09:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What?! Idiot, don't let\Nhim in! Drive him away!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.22,0:09:38.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill him!\NDon't let him return alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.38,0:09:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Duralumin! I'm sending\Nyour assassins back to you..
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.06,0:09:47.21,Default,,0,0,0,,...that you sent\Nto the coffin tower!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.58,0:09:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill him!\NKill him immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.78,0:09:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Grand Duke, what is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.34,0:10:03.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you! Isn't it good?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.02,0:10:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,One more!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.42,0:10:19.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Ole!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.02,0:10:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, Duralumin!\NThe phantom knight..
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.78,0:10:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,,...could appear\Nat any moment!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.74,0:10:36.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I will fight against you\Nuntil death!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.14,0:10:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I will soon annihilate you!\NPrepare yourself for this! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.58,0:10:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hurrah! Hurrah!\N- Long live the phantom knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.18,0:11:15.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you, innkeeper!\NBring more wine, quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.86,0:11:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, I will bring you\Nall the wine you want,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.34,0:11:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,but then do you intend\Nto pay or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.58,0:11:23.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Do you want to force us to pay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.30,0:11:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, well... yes..
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.34,0:11:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn you, try saying that again!\NDo you know who we are or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.86,0:11:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- Help! Help!\N- Innkeeper, bring us some wine
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.34,0:11:36.05,Default,,0,0,0,,or we will have this child devoured\Nby King Plastic's dogs!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.70,0:11:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- Oh, forgive me!\N- Bring some wine, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.70,0:11:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn you!\NYou will be torn apart by the dogs!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.18,0:11:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The phantom knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.18,0:11:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Soldiers of Duralumin, the phantom\Nknight will get you drunk!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.86,0:11:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Courage!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.18,0:11:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The phantom knight! How wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.22,0:12:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- The phantom knight!\N- What happened to those people?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.34,0:12:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Because they sang\Nthe song of the phantom knight,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.54,0:12:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,they will become slaves!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.22,0:12:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The song of the phantom knight?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.06,0:12:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, it's a popular song.\NIt goes like this:
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.06,0:12:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,"The phantom knight\Nis the champion"!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.82,0:12:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.82,0:12:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hooray! Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.14,0:13:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The phantom knight\Nis the champion!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.18,0:13:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you say he freed\Nthe prisoners?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.42,0:13:14.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, he's elusive! You can\Nnever know when he will show up!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.46,0:13:18.69,Default,,0,0,0,,The Phantom Knight\Nis the champion!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.74,0:13:20.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- How wonderful!\N- Idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.62,0:13:26.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Curse that Phantom Knight...!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.82,0:13:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got it! I found a way to\Ncapture the Phantom Knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.82,0:13:34.81,Default,,0,0,0,,The Phantom Knight\Nis very popular with children,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.86,0:13:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,so, if we take a child\Nhostage, he will come to free him!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.74,0:13:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,And we'll set a trap for him\Nthat he will surely fall into!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.42,0:13:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The ghost knight\Nis the champion!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.02,0:14:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The ghost knight\Nis the champion!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.74,0:14:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The ghost knight...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.42,0:14:07.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Help! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.86,0:14:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,- Taste it, it's a delicious juice.\N- Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.94,0:14:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Ghost knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.74,0:14:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Cursed ghost knight,\Nthis time you will die!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.22,0:14:35.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- Help!\N- Mama! Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.34,0:14:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Help, I'm scared!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.62,0:14:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Cry! Cry! The ghost\Nknight will come to help you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.06,0:14:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,And if he comes, we will win!\NIf he comes to this square,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.06,0:14:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,the cannon, the rockets and the arrows\Nwill attack him!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.22,0:14:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,He will die in an instant!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.58,0:15:08.57,Default,,0,0,0,,But what is he waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.18,0:15:13.89,Default,,0,0,0,,- Mom!\N- Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.34,0:15:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,What's happening, ghost\Nknight? Are you scared?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.62,0:15:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Damned ghost knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.58,0:15:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if he's scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.02,0:15:47.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Cry, children! Cry!\NAnd the knight...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.82,0:15:53.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Is coming from the sky?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.50,0:16:24.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's next!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.02,0:16:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Water! Throw some water!\NBut not on me, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.42,0:16:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.46,0:16:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm dying of rage!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.74,0:16:51.13,Default,,0,0,0,,And now go back\Nall of you home.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.18,0:16:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- Thank you, ghost knight!\N- Be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.10,0:16:58.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't get kidnapped again!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.22,0:17:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it! Damn it! Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.30,0:17:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- You are Baron Nylon, aren't you?\N- Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.30,0:17:09.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Good heavens! Don't you want\Nto know where the ghost knight is?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.50,0:17:11.41,Default,,0,0,0,,The ghost knight...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.50,0:17:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What?\NAh, how beautiful you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.26,0:17:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You are looking for the\Nghost knight, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.06,0:17:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes! I wonder where that\Ndamned knight is, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.94,0:17:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- I know!\N- What? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.06,0:17:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, please! Please,\Nbeautiful lady! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.46,0:17:28.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I will tell the Grand Duke\NDuralumin! I would be truly glad...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.26,0:17:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,...to see that clean-shaven\Nface of Grand Duke Duralumin.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.22,0:17:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, but don't you prefer to see mine?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.94,0:17:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,No! I prefer the clean-shaven\None of Duralumin!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.22,0:17:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I see... Then I will take\Nyou to the castle, alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.46,0:18:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, please have the\Ncourtesy to wait here, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.94,0:18:03.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon Grand Duke\NDuralumin will arrive.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.14,0:18:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course, I'll wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.06,0:18:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,How beautiful and kind you are,\Ndamn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.90,0:18:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, then wait here\Njust a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.10,0:18:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that the lady who knows\Nwhere the ghost knight is?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.50,0:18:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.66,0:18:28.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Then tell me:\Nwhere is the ghost knight?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.18,0:18:30.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is he? Where is the phantom knight?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.06,0:18:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to see him because he is very\Nhandsome! I want to see him because he is...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.70,0:18:37.17,Default,,0,0,0,,So, where is the phantom\Nknight? Answer me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.22,0:18:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,And show me your face!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.02,0:18:43.49,Default,,0,0,0,,He's here!\NThe phantom knight is here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.54,0:18:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- How handsome he is!\N- The phantom knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.22,0:18:52.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- Quick, someone catch him!\N- Don't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.82,0:18:56.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I promised you that I\Nwould appear in the castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.34,0:18:58.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I kept my promise!\NHere I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.78,0:19:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.70,0:19:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.10,0:19:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Catch him!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.74,0:19:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Catch him!\NTake back the crown!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.18,0:19:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,This stupid, foolish, imbecile!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.74,0:19:37.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You brought the phantom\Nknight right into my house!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.78,0:19:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I am furious!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.02,0:19:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, you are running\Nvery late today.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.82,0:20:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Gama is coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.42,0:20:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hey, open up!\N- Please, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.74,0:20:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait?! It's time for Sapphire to\Ngo get the water! Understood?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.46,0:20:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a moment, please!\NWait!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.86,0:20:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.30,0:20:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,She's not here! In fact, I thought\Nthe phantom knight was Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.18,0:20:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,- That's not true!\N- Yes, exactly!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.18,0:20:35.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, do you know what will happen to you\Nif Sapphire escapes from the castle?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.86,0:20:38.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What happens is that you will be hanged!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.74,0:20:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I warned you!\NAnd now prepare yourself for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.70,0:20:47.09,Default,,0,0,0,,No! I...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.50,0:20:50.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I am sure that Sapphire\Nwent to fetch water.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.46,0:20:53.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't lie!\NFine, I will go see!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.42,0:20:57.49,Default,,0,0,0,,But if she isn't there,\Nyou will be hanged!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.90,0:21:05.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire,\Nwe are finally at the end!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.78,0:21:23.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon we will see the sun...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.30,0:21:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Where have you been?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.86,0:21:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Since Gama forgot\Nto close the door,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.78,0:21:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I went out onto the skylight\Nto play with the mice.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.34,0:21:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,But I started fetching\Nwater at the right time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.38,0:21:40.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up! You can't do\Nwhatever you want!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.50,0:21:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't laugh!\NYet there is something strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.74,0:21:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel as if I've been tricked
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.86,0:22:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn phantom knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.86,0:22:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,How clever! Brave!\NWonderful! Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.94,0:22:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't I even kill\Na single girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.26,0:22:16.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Even the assassins\Nwere sent back!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.62,0:22:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,And that knight was not\Ncaught in our trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.10,0:22:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I've got it!\NI've got an idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.66,0:22:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fed up with your stupid ideas!\NDon't bother me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.54,0:22:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no! But this one is really good!\NThis is the best!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.22,0:22:34.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Fortunately,\Nthere's a storm outside!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.26,0:22:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't miss\Nthis opportunity!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.58,0:22:39.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd better tell Gama\Nto kill them in secret,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.30,0:22:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,rather than sending assassins.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.54,0:23:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,"Gama, today is the day\Nmost favorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.34,0:23:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill the Queen and Sapphire\Ntonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.50,0:23:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You will receive the reward\Nfrom my emissary. Baron Nylon".
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.54,0:23:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,And try to do it well!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.22,0:23:39.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Honestly, it wouldn't be my\Nintention to kill a girl,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.34,0:23:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,but I can't help it
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.82,0:23:52.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- Gama!\N- Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.10,0:23:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,May I know\Nwhere you are going at this hour?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.38,0:24:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I... well... I...\NNowhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.90,0:24:03.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You were looking for some hole\Nto escape through, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.62,0:24:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright! If you really want to get out,\Nyou can do it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.98,0:24:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,But you won't make it out alive! Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.46,0:24:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Gama! What do you want to do?!
